---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import HomeownerForm from "../components/HomeownerForm.astro";
---
<Base title="quick estimate · bubong" pathname="/me">
  <section class="max-w-prose mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-2">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-500 mb-3 font-mono">your roof · payback estimate</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4 leading-tight">How long until rooftop solar pays for itself in your city?</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      Three inputs, one number out. We use a PVGIS-derived Philippine yield baseline (~1315 kWh/kWp/yr), the current Meralco residential rate (₱12.50/kWh), and the latest ghost-watts release for your city's solar-growth signal and LGU permit cost. All math runs locally in your browser. Nothing about you is sent anywhere.
    </p>
  </section>

  <HomeownerForm />

  <section class="max-w-prose mx-auto px-6 py-6 text-xs text-ink-500">
    Estimates only. Not engineering advice. Talk to a certified installer before committing.
  </section>
</Base>
